  <h1>Spray Foam Assessment Report</h1>
  <p><strong>Prepared for:</strong> Mrs Mary Borji<br>
  <strong>Report type:</strong> Initial evidence-led spray foam assessment<br>
  <strong>Property:</strong> 11 Richland Road, Liverpool, L13 7BN</p>

